.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class USER> double \fBcsmp::Integrator\fP< dim, USER >::VerifyAndAssignResults (bool show_range, bool do_range_check)\fR [protected]\fP"

.PP
transfer results updating concentration, zeroing out 'new concentration' values, and performing range checks; returns error Checks the range of 'new saturation oil' against that specified in the property database\&. Where the new values comply, they are used to replace the previous ones stored as 'saturation oil'\&. If not, the deviations are reported and the nearest maximum or minimum permitted values of saturation are stored\&. 

